@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+# Changelog
+
+## 1.2.0
+
+- Honour `nftables_base_allowed_tcp_ports` in the generated ruleset.
+- Prefix role variables with `nftables_base_`.
+- Set file ownership and mode on the ruleset; make command tasks idempotent.
